\vspace*{0.4cm}
\begin{center}
{\Large\itshape\color{CoverGoldBright} ὁ κύριος τῆς εἰρήνης}\\[0.1cm]
{\itshape\small\color{CoverMuted} {\baskervillefont "The Lord of Peace"} · 賜平安的主——神的次序最後的落款 (3:16)}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]\hspace{0.25cm}{\color{CoverGoldBright}\rule{1.8in}{0.4pt}}\hspace{0.25cm}\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\large\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\large\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
帖撒羅尼迦人聽見一句話——「主的日子現在到了」——就動了心，有人連工也不做了。保羅的回答不是日期，是次序：那日子必到，但那日子以前必有先後；而在一切先後之先，有神從起初的揀選。本書逐段研讀帖撒羅尼迦後書全書三章，以「啟示的次序」為骨幹，整合老弟兄查經教導法、屈梭多模與加爾文的歷代注疏、G. Campbell Morgan 的全卷信息，以及 John MacArthur 逐節解經講道（gty.org）。

\vspace{0.3cm}

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}A}{}\ church was told that the day of the Lord had already come, and some stopped working. Paul answered not with a date but with an order: the Day will come, but not before its appointed sequence; and before every sequence stands God's choice "from the beginning." A passage-by-passage study of all three chapters, built on the order of revelation, drawing on Elder Wong's method of Bible study, Chrysostom and Calvin, G. Campbell Morgan, and John MacArthur's exposition (gty.org).}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\small\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 四步：神的次序}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\small\color{CoverGoldBright} Four Steps of God's Order}

\vspace{0.3cm}

\begin{minipage}{4.7in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
\begin{tabular}{@{}cp{3.4in}l@{}}
第一步 & 那日必到 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} The Day will surely come} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 1:5-12}\\[0.25em]
第二步 & 那日未到 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Not before its appointed order} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 2:1-12}\\[0.25em]
第三步 & 從起初到榮光 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} From the beginning to glory} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 2:13-17}\\[0.25em]
第四步 & 按次序而活 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Living in step with God's order} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 3:1-18}\\
\end{tabular}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\color{CoverGoldBright}\rule{2.3in}{0.6pt}}

